lines = PackedStringArray("Good evening. I wondered when you would come back.", "Sit by the fire a while. The night is long, and the road will keep.", "Do you hear that? Every clock in the hall has stopped at the same minute.", "No. I will not open the east doors, not tonight, and not for anyone.", "Perhaps I was made for waiting. Perhaps it is the thing I do best.", "Tell me, what did you see out there, past the fog?")

